---
description: Omarchy Quattro QML plugin rules
globs:
  - "*.qml"
  - "*.js"
  - "manifest.json"
  - "tests/model.test.js"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Run inside Omarchy's existing Quickshell process; never execute `qs` or `quickshell`.
- Keep `moduleName` equal to `io.github.vyomjain6904.sony-headphones` in both entry and panel.
- Load the nested panel from `BarWidget.qml`; do not add a separate panel kind.
- Read the daemon's watched JSON state file instead of polling the CLI.
- Gate every visible control on a daemon-reported capability.
- Keep parsing and labels in `Model.js`, with full default shapes and Node tests.
